commit 42c7c34578607dc26cc1af9bf917bd06248b690d
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 01:38:28 2026 +0000

    Add a committee tasks board
    
    Builds boards/tasks/ from the sheet export in incoming/tasks.csv, for the
    requests in the 29 Oct and 12 Nov minutes: one section per person so each
    member can see their own jobs, a "Nobody yet" section for unowned jobs, soonest
    due first with overdue jobs marked, and done jobs folded away.
    
    The events board groups by event date and folds whole past sections. That would
    hide overdue tasks, which are the ones that matter most here. So kit/board.py
    gains optional board.json keys (date-less sections, an empty-section label,
    row sort, a row fold, date columns). The events page builds byte-identical
    before and after the change (checked with today fixed to 2026-11-23).
    
    Data fixes in the board copy: "Done" -> "done", "priya" -> "Priya". The rota
    columns are kept in the CSV but not shown on the board.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

